{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "25", "m": "07", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "14", "M": "53", "S": "29"}}, "news": [{"title": "Uttar Pradesh RERA registers 143 projects worth \u20b931,952 crore in H1 2026", "para": "Uttar Pradesh RERA registered 143 new real estate projects in early 2026. These projects propose 46,049 housing units with substantial capital investment. Lucknow and Gautam Buddh Nagar led new project registrations and capital inflow respectively. The state's real estate sector saw consistent growth in investments and housing supply. UP-RERA also facilitated significant recovery for homebuyers and resolved property disputes.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/uttar-pradeshs-real-estate-sector-thrives-with-143-new-projects-and-31952-crore-investment-in-h1-2026/132624730?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-100764/132624730.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "DC orders closure of illegal homestays in Mysuru", "para": "Mysuru deputy commissioner ordered stringent safety measures for all homestays. Unregistered establishments must shut down immediately and obtain necessary approvals. Surprise inspections will verify safety protocols and guest record maintenance. Emergency contact numbers will be prominently displayed for tourist assistance. Tourists are advised to stay only in registered and licensed accommodations.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/hospitality/mysuru-clamps-down-on-illegal-homestays-after-tourist-assault/132624099?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1305575/132624099.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "hospitality"}, {"title": "Prayagraj civic body to rollout OTS scheme for property tax defaulters from Aug 15", "para": "Prayagraj Municipal Corporation will launch a one-time settlement scheme for outstanding taxes. Property owners can clear pending dues in three installments after applying. The scheme benefits approximately 90,000 property owners, including long-term defaulters. This initiative aims to improve tax recovery and boost civic body revenue. The scheme will be available from August 15 to December 15.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/prayagraj-municipal-corporation-launches-ots-scheme-for-property-tax-defaulters/132624052?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-638474/132624052.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}]}